{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>ונתתי</b> — It is the usage of the speakers of the holy tongue that when they mention two things, they begin to recount the second first and afterward return to the first at the end, as in: \"To you, day; also to you, night,\" and \"I will give to Isaac [from] Jacob and Esau.\" So too here: ונתתי דם בארץ ובשמים אש ותימרות עשן (\"and I will give blood on the earth, and in the heavens fire and columns of smoke\")."], :book :joel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Joel -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/yoel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:38.764650358Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}